## Privacy Policy

_Last updated: August 6, 2026_

This policy explains what information is collected when you use this website
([dana.lol](https://www.dana.lol)), **Guessr** (the daily dashcam guessing game
at [guessr.dana.lol](https://guessr.dana.lol)), and **Tripbot**, the chat bot
that runs in the live chat of the A Dana Life livestream on Twitch and YouTube.
It is written in plain language because the honest summary is short: very little
information is collected, and none of it is sold.

